    <h2>English</h2>
    <p>ORUNKA is an offline, single-player prehistoric RPG: tame wild beasts on the island of Moruah, fight alongside them and raise them. No ads, no in-app purchases, no data collection. Available on iPhone and Mac (App Store) and Windows (Steam).</p>
